<title>USA: Agri-Nutrition to acquire pet care firm.</title>
<headline>Agri-Nutrition to acquire pet care firm.</headline>
<dateline>MARYLAND HEIGHTS, Mo. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agri-Nutrition Group Ltd said Wednesday it agreed to acquire and merge with Mardel Laboratories Inc, a Glendale Heights, Ill.-based company which develops, makes and markets pet care products.</p>
<p>Markel had sales of about $7.6 million in 1996.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Completion of the proposed transaction, which requires a definitive agreement, is expected by September 30, 1997.</p>
<p>Agri-Nutrition Group produces, markets and distributes health, grooming, and nutritional products for pets.</p>
<p>			((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
